==English==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|fore|ground}}. Compare {{cog|nl|voorgrond||foreground}}, {{cog|de|Vordergrund||foreground}}, {{cog|da|forgrund||foreground}}, {{cog|sv|förgrund||foreground}}, {{cog|no|forgrunn||foreground}}, {{cog|is|forgrunni||foreground}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈfɔː(ɹ)ˌɡɹaʊnd/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-foreground.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The elements of an image which lie closest to the [[picture plane]].
# The subject of an image, often depicted at the bottom in a [[two-dimensional]] work.
# {{lb|en|computing|often|attributive}} The [[application]] the user is currently interacting with; the application window that appears in front of all others.

